abstract: |
  Machine-checked Lean 4 formalization of OmegaTheory V2 — a discrete-spacetime
  substrate-truncation framework deriving quantum mechanics, gauge theory, and
  the Standard Model from four irrational existence postulates (pi, e, sqrt 2,
  Catalan G) on a Planck-scale Z^4 lattice. Built against Mathlib v4.29.0;
  depends only on Lean core axioms (propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound) for
  paper-headline capstones. Includes formalizations of pi-transcendence (first
  in any prover), Roth's theorem on Diophantine approximation (in progress),
  Magnetic Laplacian spectral methods, and Lyapunov stability analysis.
